OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters and public 'knowingly
OL,4,Aput at risk' during summer wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters and the public were
OL,7,Fknowingly put at risk during this
OL,8,Fyear's wildfires due to chronic
OL,9,Funderfunding, a union has said.
OL,11,FThose working on the ground and in the
OL,12,FSouth Wales control centre said the
OL,13,Ffires were relentless with injuries
OL,14,F"commonplace" for crews.
OL,16,FThe Fire Brigades Union (FBU) said
OL,17,Ffirefighters were climbing hills in
OL,18,Funsuitable boots and non-breathable
OL,19,Flayers used for house fires due to not
OL,20,Fhaving enough kit, and there is a "real
OL,21,Frisk to the public" if immediate action
OL,22,Fisn't taken.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,438,430,260,140,0,100
