OL,3,GNEWSAFirefighters and public 'knowingly
OL,4,Aput at risk' during summer wildfires
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Welsh government said it didn't
OL,7,Fprovide the core funding but "recognise
OL,8,Fthe concerns raised and are clear that
OL,9,Fwe need to do all we can to reduce the
OL,10,Frisk of wildfires".
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
